 * Spring Parameter Conversion (SwiftUI formulas, mass = 1):
 *   stiffness = (2π ÷ duration)²
 *   damping = 1 - 4π × bounce ÷ duration  (bounce ≥ 0)
 *   damping = 4π ÷ (duration + 4π × bounce)  (bounce < 0)
